    "sections": {
        "description": "Hester is lightweight, modern, highly customizable multi-purpose theme. It’s perfect for blogs, small business, startups, agencies, firms, e-commerce shops as well as personal portfolio sites and most types of projects. Hester works perfectly with Gutenberg and the most popular page builders (Elementor, Brizy, Beaver Builder, Visual Composer, SiteOrigin). Hester is also WooCommerce ready, responsive &amp; translation ready. We are continuously working to build more starter sites which you can import by single click. Checkout ready to import demos at https://demo.peregrine-themes.com/hester/."
    },
